    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/graph/inferences/5/argument/2/text",
      "value": "Fix any 0<s<1, δ_1>0 and any δ_1-cover W_1 of I, with diameters (ρ_1)_i≤δ_1. One has (ρ_1)_i^s≥δ_1^{s-1}(ρ_1)_i; at (ρ_1)_i=0 both sides are zero, and for (ρ_1)_i>0 this follows since the exponent s-1 is negative. Thus F002 gives Σ_i(ρ_1)_i^s≥δ_1^{s-1}Σ_i(ρ_1)_i≥δ_1^{s-1}. Taking the infimum over the arbitrary covers W_1 yields Hscale(s,δ_1,I)≥δ_1^{s-1}→∞ as δ_1↓0. Hence Hmeasure(s,I)=∞ and N001 gives hdim(I)≥s for every 0<s<1. Let s↑1 to obtain hdim(I)≥1, which together with F001 proves hdim(I)=1. All cover and exponent quantifiers have been closed."
    },
